      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "16. (15分) 设集合 $A=\\{x\\mid(x-a+2)(x-a-2)<0\\}$，$B=\\left\\{x\\mid\\frac{2x-1}{x+2}<1\\right\\}$。\n(1) 求集合 $A$, $B$；\n(2) 若 $A\\cap(\\complement_R B)=\\varnothing$，求实数 $a$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C001"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "kept_first_pass_answer_byte_exact"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.8-max/workflow/page15/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "(1) 由题意得 $a-2$、$a+2$ 是方程 $(x-a+2)(x-a-2)=0$ 的两根，且 $a-2$ 一定小于 $a+2$。\n$\\therefore A=\\{x\\mid a-2<x<a+2\\}$。\n$B$：① $\\begin{cases} x+2>0\\\\ 2x-1<x+2\\end{cases}$ 解得 $-2<x<3$\n② $\\begin{cases} 2x-1>x+2\\\\ x+2<0\\end{cases}$ 无解。\n$\\therefore B=\\{x\\mid -2<x<3\\}$\n(2) $\\complement_R B=\\{x\\mid x\\leq -2 \\text{ 或 } x\\geq 3\\}$。\n$\\because A\\cap(\\complement_R B)=\\varnothing$\n$\\therefore$ ① $A=\\varnothing \\Rightarrow a-2\\geq a+2$ 无解。\n② $\\begin{cases} a-2>-2\\\\ a+2<3\\end{cases}$ 解得 $0<a<1$\n综上所述，$a$ 取值 $\\{a\\mid 0<a<1\\}$",
        "answer_parts": [],
        "uncertain_fragments": [],
        "status": "ok",
        "evidence_note": "C001 printed stem matches draft (A={x|(x-a+2)(x-a-2)<0}, B with fraction (2x-1)/(x+2)<1, parts (1)(2), A∩(∁_R B)=∅). Retained handwriting reproduces every drafted step: roots a-2, a+2 with a-2<a+2; A={x|a-2<x<a+2}; B case ① {x+2>0, 2x-1<x+2} giving -2<x<3 and case ② {2x-1>x+2, x+2<0} no solution; B={x|-2<x<3}; ∁_R B={x|x≤-2 or x≥3}; A=∅ branch no solution; {a-2>-2, a+2<3} giving 0<a<1; final {a|0<a<1}. Crossed-out tokens before 且 and before x+2<0 are visibly struck through and correctly excluded; no mandatory symbol or figure targets remain.",
